    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000268",
    "title": "Concerning Christian Liberty; with Letter of Martin Luther to Pope Leo X.",
    "description": "The public-domain text of Concerning Christian Liberty; with Letter of Martin Luther to Pope Leo X. by Martin Luther, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 18,
    "tags": [
      "knowledge",
