    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000300",
    "title": "The Shepherd Psalm: A Meditation",
    "description": "The public-domain text of The Shepherd Psalm: A Meditation by William Evans, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 13,
    "tags": [
