    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000305",
    "title": "The One Moss-Rose",
    "description": "The public-domain text of The One Moss-Rose by Philip Bennett Power, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 8,
