    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000311",
    "title": "A Coal From The Altar, To Kindle The Holy Fire of Zeale",
    "description": "The public-domain text of A Coal From The Altar, To Kindle The Holy Fire of Zeale by Samuel Ward, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 15,
    "tags": [
      "knowledge",
      "wisdom",
      "discipleship"
    ],
    "cover_image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505506874110-6a7a69069a08?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
    "source_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/16423",
